    ],
    "physical_description": "The bag is formed in the traditional way. One length of cloth folded in half (the fold forming the pocket of the bag) stitched to a second length forming the sides and carrying strap.\r\n\r\nRed ground interrupted by a series of black, green, white and red coloured warp bands which form a frame for supplementary weft patterning of green; red and white diamonds and yellow zig-zag motifs. These stripes are bisected at the top of the bag with bands of yellow woven in a diamond twill weave.",
